{"suttaId":"sn29.11-20","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iii","vriCode":"s0303m.mul","paras":[1277,1278],"vripara":"352-361"},"segments":{"sn29.11-20:0.3":"11-20. Aṇḍajadānūpakārasuttadasakaṃ","sn29.11-20:1.1":"Ekamantaṃ nisinno kho so bhikkhu bhagavantaṃ etadavoca –","sn29.11-20:1.2":"“ko nu kho, bhante, hetu, ko paccayo, yena midhekacco kāyassa bhedā paraṃ maraṇā aṇḍajānaṃ nāgānaṃ sahabyataṃ upapajjatī”ti?","sn29.11-20:2.1":"“Idha, bhikkhu, ekacco kāyena dvayakārī hoti, vācāya dvayakārī, manasā dvayakārī.","sn29.11-20:2.2":"Tassa sutaṃ hoti –","sn29.11-20:2.3":"‘aṇḍajā nāgā dīghāyukā vaṇṇavanto sukhabahulā’ti.","sn29.11-20:2.4":"Tassa evaṃ hoti –","sn29.11-20:2.5":"‘aho vatāhaṃ kāyassa bhedā paraṃ maraṇā aṇḍajānaṃ nāgānaṃ sahabyataṃ upapajjeyya’nti.","sn29.11-20:2.6":"So annaṃ deti.","sn29.11-20:2.7":"So kāyassa bhedā paraṃ maraṇā aṇḍajānaṃ nāgānaṃ sahabyataṃ upapajjati.","sn29.11-20:2.8":"Ayaṃ kho, bhikkhu, hetu…pe… upapajjatīti…pe…","sn29.11-20:2.9":"so pānaṃ deti…pe…","sn29.11-20:2.10":"vatthaṃ deti…pe…","sn29.11-20:2.11":"yānaṃ deti…pe…","sn29.11-20:2.12":"mālaṃ deti…pe…","sn29.11-20:2.13":"gandhaṃ deti…pe…","sn29.11-20:2.14":"vilepanaṃ deti…pe…","sn29.11-20:2.15":"seyyaṃ deti…pe…","sn29.11-20:2.16":"āvasathaṃ deti…pe…","sn29.11-20:2.17":"padīpeyyaṃ deti.","sn29.11-20:2.18":"So kāyassa bhedā paraṃ maraṇā aṇḍajānaṃ nāgānaṃ sahabyataṃ upapajjati.","sn29.11-20:2.19":"Ayaṃ kho, bhikkhu, hetu, ayaṃ paccayo, yena midhekacco kāyassa bhedā paraṃ maraṇā aṇḍajānaṃ nāgānaṃ sahabyataṃ upapajjatī”ti.","sn29.11-20:2.20":"Vīsatimaṃ. 21-50."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Spk-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0303a.att","from":468,"to":470,"paras":[{"para":468,"vripara":"343-391","refs":["sn29.11-20:1"],"lines":["Dutiyādīsu <b>vossaṭṭhakāyā</b>ti ahituṇḍikaparibuddhaṃ agaṇetvā vissaṭṭhakāyā.","<b>Dvayakārino</b>ti duvidhakārino, kusalākusalakārinoti attho.","<b>Sacajja maya</b>nti sace ajja mayaṃ.","<b>Sahabyataṃ upapajjatī</b>ti sahabhāvaṃ āpajjati.","Tatrassa akusalaṃ upapattiyā paccayo hoti, kusalaṃ upapannānaṃ sampattiyā.","<b>Anna</b>nti khādanīyabhojanīyaṃ.","<b>Pāna</b>nti yaṃkiñci pānakaṃ.","<b>Vattha</b>nti nivāsanapārupanaṃ.","<b>Yāna</b>nti chattupāhanaṃ ādiṃ katvā yaṃkiñci gamanapaccayaṃ.","<b>Māla</b>nti yaṃkiñci sumanamālādipupphaṃ.","<b>Gandha</b>nti yaṃkiñci candanādigandhaṃ.","<b>Vilepana</b>nti yaṃkiñci chavirāgakaraṇaṃ.","<b>Seyyāvasathapadīpeyya</b>nti mañcapīṭhādiseyyaṃ ekabhūmikādiāvasathaṃ vaṭṭitelādipadīpūpakaraṇañca detīti attho.","Tesañhi dīghāyukatāya ca vaṇṇavantatāya ca sukhabahulatāya ca patthanaṃ katvā imaṃ dasavidhaṃ dānavatthuṃ datvā taṃ sampattiṃ anubhavituṃ tattha nibbattanti.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"]]},{"para":469,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn29.11-20:1"],"lines":["Nāgasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 9."],"lineRefs":[["sn29.11-20:1"]]},{"para":470,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn29.11-20:1"],"lines":["Supaṇṇasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā 392-437."],"lineRefs":[["sn29.11-20:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0303t.tik","from":495,"to":498,"paras":[{"para":495,"vripara":"343-391","refs":["sn29.11-20:1"],"lines":["<b>Vissaṭṭhakāyā</b>ti “ye cammena vā rudhirena vā aṭṭhinā vā atthikā, te sabbaṃ gaṇhantū”ti tattha nirapekkhacittatāya adhiṭṭhitasīlatāya pariccattasarīrā.","<b>Duvidhakārino</b>ti “kālena kusalaṃ, kālena akusala”nti evaṃ kusalākusalakārino.","Saha byayati pavattatīti sahabyo, sahacāro.","Tassa bhāvo sahabyatā, taṃ <b>sahabyataṃ</b>.","Adanīyato <b>annaṃ</b>.","Khādanīyato <b>khajjaṃ</b>.","Pātabbato <b>pānaṃ</b>.","Nivasanīyato <b>vatthaṃ</b>.","Nivasitabbaṃ <b>nivāsanaṃ</b>.","Parivaritabbaṃ <b>pāvuraṇaṃ</b>.","Yānti tenāti <b>yānaṃ,</b> upāhanādiyānāni.","Ādisaddena vayhasivikādīnaṃ saṅgaho.","Chattampi parissayātapadukkhaparirakkhaṇena maggagamanasādhananti katvā <b>“chattupāhana”</b>ntiādi vuttaṃ.","Tena vuttaṃ <b>“yaṃ kiñci gamanapaccaya”</b>nti.","<b>Patthanaṃ katvā…pe… tattha nibbattanti</b> campeyyanāgarājā viyāti daṭṭhabbaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"],["sn29.11-20:1"]]},{"para":496,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn29.11-20:1"],"lines":["Paṇītatarasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn29.11-20:1"]]},{"para":497,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn29.11-20:1"],"lines":["Nāgasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 9."],"lineRefs":[["sn29.11-20:1"]]},{"para":498,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn29.11-20:1"],"lines":["Supaṇṇasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā 392-437."],"lineRefs":[["sn29.11-20:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
